{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36691","headline":"寄张侍郎 · 罗隐","name":"寄张侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衰羸岂合话荆州，争奈思多不自由。\n无路重趋桓典马，有诗曾上仲宣楼。\n尘销别迹堪垂泪，树拂他门嬾举头。\n一种人间太平日，独教零落忆沧州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36691.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36691","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}